<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  /* Terms & Conditions — printed "overleaf" on the letterhead after the quotation */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: #000; background: transparent; }
  .page { width: 100%; }
  .title { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .ref { text-align: center; font-size: 9.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  ol { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px 14px 10px 30px; line-height: 1.55; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 2px; }
  li b { font-weight: 700; }
  .accept { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .accept div { width: 42%; border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 4px; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="title">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</div>
  <div class="ref">Spare Parts Quotation <b><%= q.quotation_no %></b> · <%= q.customer_name %></div>
  <ol>
    <li><b>Quotation Validity:</b> This quotation is valid for <%= q.validity_days || 7 %> days from the date of issue. Prices are subject to change thereafter.</li>
    <li><b>Taxes:</b> GST and other applicable government taxes/levies shall be charged as applicable on the date of invoicing.</li>
    <li><b>Payment:</b> Payment shall be made as per agreed payment terms. Delay in payment may attract applicable interest/charges.</li>
    <li><b>Order Confirmation:</b> An order is confirmed only upon receipt of the required advance/payment and written acceptance by the Company.</li>
    <li><b>Delivery:</b> Delivery is subject to availability and receipt of agreed payment. Timelines are indicative and may vary due to circumstances beyond the Company's control.</li>
    <li><b>Transportation:</b> Transportation, insurance, registration, road tax, permits and incidental charges shall be borne by the customer unless specifically included.</li>
    <li><b>Warranty:</b> Warranty is governed strictly by the manufacturer's terms. It does not cover wear and tear, misuse, negligence, accidents or unauthorised repairs.</li>
    <li><b>Specifications:</b> Product specifications, features and configurations are subject to change by the manufacturer without prior notice.</li>
    <li><b>Cancellation &amp; Refund:</b> Cancellation is subject to the Company's approval. Applicable cancellation, processing or restocking charges may be deducted.</li>
    <li><b>Documentation:</b> Registration, insurance, financing and statutory documentation shall be the customer's responsibility unless specifically agreed otherwise.</li>
    <li><b>Invoice:</b> The invoice shall be treated as the final document for quantity, model, specifications, price, taxes and other commercial terms.</li>
    <li><b>Force Majeure:</b> The Company shall not be liable for any delay caused by natural calamities, strikes, government restrictions, shortage of materials or manufacturer-related delays.</li>
    <li><b>Jurisdiction:</b> Any dispute shall be subject to the jurisdiction of competent courts at Meerut, Uttar Pradesh.</li>
    <li><b>Acceptance:</b> Placement of an order or acceptance of delivery shall constitute acceptance of these terms and conditions.</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="accept">
    <div>Customer's Seal and Signature</div>
    <div>for <b><%= String(settings.company_name || 'SUPER ALLIED').toUpperCase() %></b> · Authorised Signatory</div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
